{
  "slug": "loreconvo",
  "name": "Loreconvo",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Cross-surface persistent memory for Claude sessions. Vault conversations from Code, Cowork, and Chat — recall decisions, artifacts, and context in any future session.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `lore-onboard` (First-time setup wizard for LoreConvo), `loreconvo` (Vault your Claude conversations for cross-session recall), `using-loreconvo` (Overview and orientation for LoreConvo)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `loreconvo`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install loreconvo@claude-community` from `labyrinth-analytics/loreconvo`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
